driveu-decoder-gstreamer (1.02.0) bionic; urgency=medium

  * Fix no-GPU GStreamer decoder producing corrupted video
  * Remove 500KB static frame buffer cap that silently dropped I-frames
  * Replace static array with dynamic vector; reserve 4MB/slot to prevent
    reallocation while GStreamer holds a raw pointer (use-after-free)
  * Fix DTS set to frame index instead of PTS (wrong decode order)
  * Fix frame duration set to 1s (misled GStreamer jitter/pacing)
  * Fix appsrc max-bytes=5000 dropping frames before decode
  * Fix UV plane copy: copy U and V as separate planes, not combined
  * Auto-detect H264/H265 codec and set appsrc caps on first frame

 -- adi <adi@driveu.auto>  Sun, 07 Jun 2026 13:30:00 +0300

